      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "How do those two findings of materiality\n21 differ? How does the finding that you say must be made\n22 at the certification stage differ from the finding that\n23 must be made at the trial?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "United States (amicus curiae)",
